{"ticker":"WM","updated":"2026-10-30T23:23:14Z","profile":{"longName":"Waste Management, Inc.","shortName":"Waste Management, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Waste Management","country":"United States","website":"https://www.wm.com","fullTimeEmployees":60500,"marketCap":92827869184,"trailingPE":30.636482,"forwardPE":26.061522,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.5607162,"pegRatio":2.12,"targetMeanPrice":255.36,"targetHighPrice":283.0,"targetLowPrice":220.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":25,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.063,"earningsGrowth":0.376,"grossMargins":0.40387002,"operatingMargins":0.19384001,"profitMargins":0.11776,"totalRevenue":26069999616,"beta":0.43,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":248.13,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":194.11,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.64},"summary":"Waste Management, Inc., through its subsidiaries, provides environmental solutions to residential, commercial, industrial, and municipal customers in the United States, Canada, Western Europe, and internationally. It offers collection services, including picking up and transporting waste and recyclable materials from where it was generated to a transfer station, recovery facility, or disposal site; owns and operates transfer stations; and owns, develops, and operates landfill gas-to-energy facilities that produce renewable electricity and renewable natural gas. It also operates materials processing and commodities recycling services, including cardboard, paper, glass, metals, plastics, construction and demolition materials, and other recycling commodities are recovered for resale or redirected for other purposes; markets and resells recycling commodities; recycling brokerage services, such as managing the marketing of recyclable materials for third parties; and other strategic business solutions. In addition, the company collects recyclable food and yard waste, as well as markets and sells mulch, compost, soil amendments, and renewable energy; offers remediation and construction, and industrial waste services; and manages and markets fly ash. Further, it provides Regulated Waste and Compliance Services (RWCS), which offers compliance programs, as well as collection, processing,","summary_zh":"廢棄物管理公司透過其子公司為美國、加拿大、西歐和國際上的住宅、商業、工業和市政客戶提供環境解決方案。它提供收集服務，包括拾取廢物和可回收材料並將其從產生地運輸到轉運站、回收設施或處置場；擁有並經營轉運站；擁有、開發和運營垃圾填埋氣發電設施，生產可再生電力和可再生天然氣。它還經營材料加工和商品回收服務，包括紙板、紙張、玻璃、金屬、塑膠、建築和拆除材料，以及其他回收商品被回收用於轉售或重新用於其他目的；市場和轉售回收商品；回收經紀服務，例如管理第三方可回收材料的營銷；以及其他戰略業務解決方案。此外，該公司還收集可回收食品和庭院垃圾，並在市場上銷售覆蓋物、堆肥、土壤改良劑和再生能源；提供修復和建築以及工業廢物服務；並管理和銷售粉煤灰。此外，它還提供管制廢物和合規服務 (RWCS)，該服務提供合規計劃以及收集、處理、","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"廢棄物管理","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":226.42,"h":226.85,"l":223.73,"c":225.73,"v":2548900},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":224.99,"h":226.27,"l":222.94,"c":224.41,"v":1636400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":224.58,"h":226.24,"l":224.11,"c":224.95,"v":1517300},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":224.54,"h":224.85,"l":218.66,"c":220.06,"v":2113100},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":220.01,"h":220.61,"l":217.87,"c":219.05,"v":1509200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":218.74,"h":219.37,"l":217.1,"c":219.16,"v":1520200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":218.36,"h":219.35,"l":216.83,"c":217.69,"v":1183400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":217.58,"h":220.79,"l":215.45,"c":220.5,"v":1840900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":219.76,"h":220.67,"l":217.56,"c":218.16,"v":1087200},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":218.61,"h":219.08,"l":216.01,"c":216.13,"v":1299500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":216.14,"h":216.53,"l":213.71,"c":213.88,"v":2126500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":214.5,"h":217.15,"l":214.0,"c":215.66,"v":1375500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":214.86,"h":216.96,"l":214.26,"c":215.92,"v":1142500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":216.95,"h":217.67,"l":216.0,"c":216.4,"v":2837700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":216.53,"h":217.5,"l":215.67,"c":216.99,"v":1423900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":216.42,"h":218.36,"l":215.2,"c":218.23,"v":1480300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":217.92,"h":220.37,"l":216.9,"c":219.42,"v":1557900},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":220.46,"h":221.62,"l":217.14,"c":217.16,"v":1900900},{"t":"20