t":6},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":4},{"name":"併購","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-09","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/823768/000110465926012049/wm-20251231x10k.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Waste Management, Inc. is a holding company and all operations are conducted by its subsidiaries. When the terms \"the Company,\" \"we,\" \"us\" or \"our\" are used in this document, those terms refer to Waste Management, Inc., together with its consolidated subsidiaries and consolidated variable interest entities. When we use the term \"WMI,\" we are referring only to Waste Management, Inc., the parent holding company.","zh":"廢棄物管理公司是一家控股公司，所有業務均由其子公司進行。當本文件中使用「本公司」、「我們」、「我們」或「我們的」等術語時，這些術語是指 Waste Management, Inc. 及其合併子公司和合併可變利益實體。當我們使用「WMI」一詞時，我們僅指母公司 Waste Management, Inc.。"},{"en":"WMI was incorporated in Oklahoma in 1987 under the name \"USA Waste Services, Inc.\" and was reincorporated as a Delaware company in 1995. In a 1998 merger, the Illinois-based waste services company formerly known as Waste Management, Inc. became a wholly-owned subsidiary of WMI and changed its name to Waste Management Holdings, Inc. (\"WM Holdings\"). At the same time, our parent holding company changed its name from USA Waste Services to Waste Management, Inc. Like WMI, WM Holdings is a holding company and all operations are conducted by subsidiaries.","zh":"WMI 於 1987 年在俄克拉荷馬州成立，名為「USA Waste Services, Inc.」。並於 1995 年重組為特拉華州公司。在 1998 年的合併中，這家位於伊利諾州的廢棄物服務公司（原名 Waste Management, Inc.）成為 WMI 的全資子公司，並更名為 Waste Management Holdings, Inc.（「WM Holdings」）。同時，我們的母控股公司從 USA Waste Services 更名為 Waste Management, Inc.。與 WMI 一樣，WM Holdings 也是一家控股公司，所有業務均由子公司進行。"},{"en":"Our principal executive offices are located at 800 Capitol Street, Suite 3000, Houston, Texas 77002. Our telephone number is (713) 512-6200. Our website address is www.wm.com. Our annual reports on Form 10-K, quarterly reports on Form 10-Q and current reports on Form 8-K are all available, free of charge, on our website as soon as practicable after we file the reports with the SEC. Our stock is traded on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol \"WM.\"","zh":"我們的主要執行辦公室位於 800 Capitol Street, Suite 3000, Houston, Texas 77002。我們的電話號碼是 (713) 512-6200。我們的網址是 www.wm.com。在我們向 SEC 提交報告後，我們的 10-K 表格年度報告、10-Q 表格季度報告和 8-K 表格當前報告均可在我們的網站上免費取得。我們的股票在紐約證券交易所交易，代號為「WM」。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We are North America's leading provider of comprehensive environmental solutions, providing services throughout the United States (\"U.S.\") and Canada. We partner with our customers and the communities we serve to manage and reduce waste at each stage from collection to disposal, while recovering valuable resources and creating clean, renewable energy. Our solid waste business is operated and managed locally by our subsidiaries that focus on distinct geographic areas and provide collection, transfer, disposal, recycling and resource recovery services. Through our Waste Management Renewable Energy (\"Renewable Energy\") segment, we are also a leading developer, operator and owner of landfill gas-to-energy facilities in the U.S. and Canada that produce renewable electricity and renewable natural gas (\"RNG\"), which is a significant source of fuel that we allocate to our natural gas fleet. Foll","zh":"我們是北美領先的綜合環境解決方案供應商，在美國（“美國”）和加拿大提供服務。我們與客戶和我們服務的社區合作，管理和減少從收集到處置的每個階段的廢物，同時回收寶貴的資源並創造清潔的可再生能源。我們的固體廢棄物業務由我們的子公司在當地營運和管理，這些子公司專注於不同的地理區域，並提供收集、轉移、處置、回收和資源回收服務。透過我們的廢棄物管理再生能源（「再生能源」）部門，我們也是美國和加拿大垃圾掩埋氣發電設施的領先開發商、營運商和所有者，這些設施生產再生電力和再生天然氣（「RNG」），這是我們分配給天然氣船隊的重要燃料來源。福爾"}],"competition":[{"en":"We encounter intense competition from governmental, quasi-governmental and private sources in all aspects of our operations. We principally compete with large national waste management companies, counties and municipalities that maintain their own waste collection and disposal operations and regional and local companies of varying sizes and financial resources. The industry also includes companies that specialize in certain discrete areas of waste management, operators of alternative disposal facilities, companies that seek to use parts of the waste stream as feedstock for renewable energy and other by-products and waste brokers that rely upon haulers in local markets to address customer needs.","zh":"我們在營運的各個方面都面臨著來自政府、半政府和私人來源的激烈競爭。我們主要與大型國家廢棄物管理公司、擁有自己的廢棄物收集和處置業務的縣和市以及規模和財力不同的區域和地方公司競爭。該行業還包括專門從事廢物管理某些離散領域的公司、替代處置設施的運營商、尋求利用部分廢物流作為可再生能源和其他副產品原料的公司以及依靠當地市場的運輸商來滿足客戶需求的廢物經紀人。"},{"en":"Operating costs, disposal costs and collection fees vary widely throughout the geographic areas in which we operate. The prices that we charge are determined locally, and typically vary by volume and weight, type of waste collected, treatment requirements, risk of handling or disposal, frequency of collections, distance to final disposal sites, the availability of airspace within the geographic region, labor costs and amount and type of equipment furnished to the customer. We face intense competition based on pricing and quality of service. We also compete for business based on breadth of service offerings. As companies, individuals and communities look for ways to be more sustainable, we are promoting our comprehensive services that go beyond our core business of collecting and disposing of waste in order to meet their needs.","zh":"在我們經營所在的地理區域中，營運成本、處置成本和收集費用差異很大。我們收取的價格是根據當地確定的，通常根據體積和重量、收集的廢物類型、處理要求、處理或處置的風險、收集頻率、到最終處置地點的距離、地理區域內空域的可用性、勞動力成本以及向客戶提供的設備的數量和類型而有所不同。我們面臨著基於價格和服務品質的激烈競爭。我們也根據服務範圍的廣度來爭取業務。隨著公司、個人和社區尋找更永續的方法，我們正在推廣我們的綜合服務，這些服務超越了我們收集和處理廢棄物的核心業務，以滿足他們的需求。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Collection & Disposal","val":25545000000,"zh":"收集與處置"},{"name":"East Tier Region Areas","val":11482000000,"zh":"東線地區"},{"name":"West Tier Region Areas","val":10900000000,"zh":"西線地區"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":3163000000,"zh":"所有其他部門"},{"name":"Healthcare Solutions","val":2951000000,"zh":"醫療保健解決方案"},{"name":"Recycling Processing & Sales","val":1866000000,"zh":"回收加工及銷售"},{"name":"Renewable Energy","val":481000000,"zh":"再生能源部門"}],"total":25204000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Collection & Disposal","val":25545000000,"zh":"收集與處置"},{"name":"Collection","val":17569000000,"zh":"收藏"},{"name":"Commercial","val":6520000000,"zh":"商業的"},{"name":"Landfill","val":5347000000,"zh":"垃圾掩埋場"},{"name":"Industrial","val":3989000000,"zh":"工業的"},{"name":"Residential","val":3597000000,"zh":"住宅"},{"name":"Other Collection","val":3463000000,"zh":"其他系列"},{"name":"Healthcare Solutions","val":2951000000,"zh":"醫療保健解決方案"},{"name":"Transfer","val":2629000000,"zh":"轉移"},{"name":"Recycling Processing & Sales","val":1866000000,"zh":"回收加工及銷售"}],"total":25204000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":23911000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"CA","val":967000000,"zh":"加拿大"},{"name":"Western Europe & Other Countries","val":326000000,"zh":"西歐及其他國家"}],"total":25204000000}},"peers":["MMM","PEP","UPS","CAT","RSG"]}}